:: MP Daily Robin 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深后的孤儿院卧室只亮着床头小灯，<<else>>安静的孤儿院双人卧室里，<</if>>罗宾正把新织好的蓝灰毛线护腕摆在木匣里，旁边搁着一团备用绒线与竹针：「天凉的时候戴上它，干活就不会冻着手腕了。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回罗宾身边 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_robin_10 is 1>>
蓝灰毛线护腕已贴身戴好，腕间满是罗宾一针一线的暖意。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去下一处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-robin-10">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "试戴护腕 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-10">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 400>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_10 to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 2>><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_robin_10_rew")>><<money 380>>罗宾开心地替你理平护腕折边，把本周热可可摊攒下的分红塞进你手心。<<else>>细密绒线贴合着手腕，罗宾握着你的手掌贴在自己脸颊边。<</if>><span class="green">罗宾纯挚的关怀驱散了你一身的寒意。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你抬手太急，衣袖挂住了护腕边缘的收口线头。<span class="red">罗宾忙按住你的手腕替你轻轻解开。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "收好绒线尾结 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-10">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 230>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_10 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_robin_10_knit"] to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 2>><</if>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_robin_10_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>线头收得平整隐蔽，罗宾惊喜地抱住你的肩膀，分给你一袋手织平安绒结。<<else>>两副护腕并排收进木匣，你们肩并肩靠在床沿低语。<</if>><span class="green">默契的手工配合让卧室里暖意融融。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	竹针尖端略滑，收尾时线环松了半扣。<span class="red">罗宾手把手带着你挑紧线环。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Robin 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>窗外细雨敲打着孤儿院阁楼天窗，<<else>>孤儿院阁楼储物间透进温和天光，<</if>>罗宾正蹲在木箱前整理要送往集市寄卖的手工木偶，箱角放着一瓶清漆与一叠彩纸价签：「有你在旁边帮忙，我心里一下子就踏实了。」
<<if $mpClues["clue_robin_10_knit"]>><span class="teal">戴着昨晚一起收尾的蓝灰毛线护腕，你搬动木箱时手腕既保暖又利索。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回罗宾身边 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_robin_11 is 1>>
寄卖木偶已全部装匣贴妥，罗宾脸上洋溢着安心的笑意。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-robin-11">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "给木偶上清漆 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-11">>
<<if (($tending or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_robin_10_knit'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_11 to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 2>><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_robin_11_rew")>><<money 420>>木偶表面泛起温润光泽，罗宾把寄卖预支的定金分了一半装进你口袋。<<else>>清漆干透后木纹清晰，罗宾靠在你身旁一一定好编号。<</if>><span class="green">你们合力备妥了整箱寄卖木偶。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	漆刷蘸得稍多，木偶底座边缘挂了一滴清漆珠。<span class="red">罗宾递来干布帮你轻轻拭平。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "写好寄卖价签 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-11">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_11 to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 2>><</if>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_robin_11_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>端秀字迹令木偶更显精致，罗宾欢喜地亲了下你的脸颊，塞给你一枚手绘木书签。<<else>>彩纸价签整整齐齐系在木偶腕上，阁楼里满是欢声笑语。<</if>><span class="green">井井有条的账目与价签让寄卖万无一失。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">继续同行 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	阁楼木板微晃，钢笔尖在彩纸角划出了一道浅印。<span class="red">罗宾替你按稳木板桌面。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Eden 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜风吹拂着林间木屋的松木屋檐，<<else>>林间木屋的壁炉里柴火哔剥作响，<</if>>伊甸正坐在长条木凳上用油石打磨猎刀，桌边放着一罐蜂蜡膏与一捆新鞣好的鹿皮条：「过来坐，把你常穿的那双靴子拿来我看看。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回伊甸身边 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_eden_10 is 1>>
靴底与刀鞘均已保养妥当，木屋里弥漫着让人安心的松木香。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-eden-10">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "擦亮猎靴 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-eden-10">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_eden_10 to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 2>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_eden_10_rew")>><<money 420>>猎靴擦得油亮防潮，伊甸满意地揉了揉你的头发，把卖鹿皮余下的银币塞给你。<<else>>蜂蜡渗入皮革纹理，伊甸顺势将你的脚踝拢在膝头暖着。<</if>><span class="green">伊甸笨拙却笃定的照拂令你格外踏实。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	蜂蜡膏受凉略硬，涂抹时在靴尖留下一小块白蜡。<span class="red">伊甸把铁盒移近炉火烤软。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "缠紧刀柄 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-eden-10">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_eden_10 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_eden_10_strap"] to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 2>><<npcincr Eden trust 2>><</if>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_eden_10_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>鹿皮条缠得紧实合手，伊甸试了试握感，从铁盒里取出一卷特制护身骨哨交给你。<<else>>刀柄纹路贴合掌心，伊甸把你揽进怀里低声叮嘱林间忌讳。<</if>><span class="green">你们在静谧炉火旁配合得天衣无缝。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	鹿皮条拉得过急，收口处在指节上勒出一道红印。<span class="red">伊甸握住你的手掌替你压住皮条。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Eden 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>林间细雨打湿了木屋后院的晾肉架，<<else>>木屋后院菜畦旁，<</if>>伊甸正加固储菜窖的橡木顶盖，手边摆着一桶防潮木炭与一把短柄铁锤：「搭把手把这层木炭铺匀，往后几个月都不愁缺鲜菜吃。」
<<if $mpClues["clue_eden_10_strap"]>><span class="teal">握着缠好鹿皮防滑条的工具柄，你使力时掌心稳健而毫不磨手。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回伊甸身边 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_eden_11 is 1>>
后院储菜窖已加固密封完毕，过冬的储备一应俱全。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-eden-11">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "铺平窖底木炭 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-eden-11">>
<<if (($tending or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_eden_10_strap'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_eden_11 to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 2>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_eden_11_rew")>><<money 450>>窖底铺得干爽匀净，伊甸拭去你鼻尖的一点炭灰，把林场分红塞进你衣兜。<<else>>木炭吸净了地窖潮气，伊甸单手托起你稳稳抱出窖口。<</if>><span class="green">充实的家务让这座林间木屋更像真正的家。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">道别离开 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	木桶边沿磕在石阶上，几块木炭滚落到脚边。<span class="red">伊甸伸手扶稳木桶。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "钉牢橡木盖 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-eden-11">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11500 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_eden_11 to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden love 2>><<npcincr Eden trust 2>><</if>><<willpower 1>><<gwillpower>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_eden_11_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>四枚铁钉一气呵成钉入木梁，伊甸眼底闪过赞赏，把私藏的上等硝制鹿皮护腕交给你。<<else>>橡木顶盖严丝合缝，伊甸从身后环住你的腰陪你看林间飞鸟。<</if>><span class="green">并肩劳作的默契让伊甸对你愈发信赖。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	橡木木质坚硬，铁锤落下时震得手腕微麻。<span class="red">伊甸接过铁锤替你找准木纹。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Daily Eden 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest Cabin]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Daily Wren 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks_building">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜航船靠岸后的二号栈桥仓库内灯影昏黄，<<else>>避开巡逻线的二号栈桥私密隔间里，<</if>>雷恩正倚在木箱旁清点一匣刚到港的异国银币，桌角放着一架小铜秤与一本货运暗码簿：「来得正好，帮我把这批成色最好的挑出来。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回雷恩身边 (0:03)|Mer Street]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDaily_wren_10 is 1>>
异国银币与货运暗码今日已核对完毕，雷恩冲你潇洒地眨了眨眼。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP Daily Wren 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去下一处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-daily-wren-10">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "称定银币 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-wren-10">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_wren_10 to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>><<npcincr Wren love 2>><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("daily_wren_10_rew")>><<money 440>>足重银币挑得分毫不差，雷恩弹起一枚银币落进你怀里，又推给你一叠抽成。<<else>>铜秤托盘起落有致，雷恩懒洋洋地撑着下巴看你忙碌。<</if>><span class="green">你精准的眼力让雷恩省下了一大半工夫。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>><<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Mer Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">道别离开 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	铜秤砝码滑落桌面，秤杆晃动不止。<span class="red">雷恩伸指替你按稳秤盘。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Daily Wren 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Mer Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "折算汇率 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-wren-10">>
