:: MP RelDay Vesper 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks_building">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜航归来的旗舰船长室内鲸油灯火通明，<<else>>停泊在私港的旗舰船长室内安静宽敞，<</if>>维斯正将一幅新绘的远洋群岛海图钉在柚木壁板上，桌边放着几枚黄铜图钉与一壶热朗姆茶：「等这趟航线打通，第一座岛就用你的名字命名。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回维斯身边 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_vesper_11 is 1>>
远洋群岛海图已端正钉在船长室主墙上，茶香混着海风令人心旷神怡。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去下一处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-vesper-11">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "钉牢海图四角 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-vesper-11">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_vesper_11 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Vesper love 2>><<mpnpcincr Vesper trust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_vesper_11_rew")>><<money 460>>海图平整舒展，维斯从身后圈住你的肩膀吻过你的耳廓，将新航线的头份红利塞进你手里。<<else>>黄铜图钉在灯下闪亮，维斯握着你的手指在海图航线上缓缓划过。<</if>><span class="green">维斯许给你的远洋未来炽热而真挚。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Docks]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">道别离开 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	羊皮海图边缘略硬，按压时一角微微弹起。<span class="red">维斯伸出宽大的手掌替你按平图角。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link "斟热朗姆茶 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-vesper-11">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_vesper_11 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_vesper_11_chart"] to 1>><<mpnpcincr Vesper love 2>><<mpnpcincr Vesper lust 1>><<control 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_vesper_11_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>温热茶汤驱散海寒，维斯将你拉坐在海图桌沿深深拥吻，把船长私库信物铜牌交给你。<<else>>朗姆甜香在唇齿间流转，你们并肩规划着下一趟远航的停靠港。<</if>><span class="green">船长室里的温存让狂风巨浪都化作了耳畔低语。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	船身随涌浪轻轻一晃，茶壶嘴的热水溅湿了木托盘。<span class="red">维斯稳稳扶住你的腰身。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">斟满热朗姆茶递给维斯 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Vesper 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>细雨初歇的海港甲板上空气格外清冽，<<else>>海天相接的旗舰前甲板上，<</if>>维斯取出一枚用深海黑珍珠与纯银锚链编成的手环，舵台旁还放着一只单筒夜视铜镜：「戴上它，整支船队见手环如见我本人。」
<<if $mpClues["clue_vesper_11_chart"]>><span class="teal">刚在船长室一同钉好远洋群岛海图，此刻迎着海风远眺更觉胸怀开阔。</span><</if>>
