<<getouticon>><<link [[回维斯身边 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_vesper_12 is 1>>
深海黑珍珠锚链手环戴在腕间，船队水手经过时纷纷恭敬行礼。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-vesper-12">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "扣好银锚手环 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-vesper-12">>
<<if (($seductionskill or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_vesper_11_chart'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_vesper_12 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Vesper love 2>><<mpnpcincr Vesper trust 2>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_vesper_12_rew")>><<money 500>>银锚搭扣严丝合缝，维斯将你拢入大衣怀中热烈献吻，把本季远航厚酬塞进你口袋。<<else>>黑珍珠在海面波光下泛着幽泽，维斯紧握着你的手并肩立在船首。<</if>><span class="green">你已成为维斯在这片大海上唯一的归宿与港湾。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Docks]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海风吹起你的发丝，遮住了手环细小的银锚环扣。<span class="red">维斯替你把碎发别到耳后。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "远眺航标 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-vesper-12">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_vesper_12 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Vesper love 2>><<mpnpcincr Vesper lust 1>><<control 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_vesper_12_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>远海灯塔在镜中清晰如昼，维斯大笑着从身后抱起你，分给你一份压舱贵宾铜牌。<<else>>夜视镜筒调焦顺滑，维斯贴着你的脸颊指向远方命名给你的岛屿方向。<</if>><span class="green">辽阔海天见证着你们并肩同行的誓言。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海面薄雾掠过，夜视镜外镜片蒙上了一层水汽。<span class="red">维斯抽出鹿皮巾替你擦净镜头。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
