	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>><<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Park]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">道别离开 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	驼毛笔尖极软，靠近花蕊时你的呼吸吹晃了花丝。<span class="red">诺艾尔轻轻托住你的手腕稳住角度。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
