<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_noel_11 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_noel_11_orchid"] to 1>><<mpnpcincr Noel love 2>><<mpnpcincr Noel trust 2>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_noel_11_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>罩内温湿度瞬间恒定，诺艾尔满眼欢喜地牵住你的手，把一笔标本稿酬分给你。<<else>>水晶罩映出花瓣柔光，诺艾尔依偎在你肩头轻声念着为你写的观察笔记。<</if>><span class="green">静谧花房里流淌着只属于你们两人的温柔时光。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP RelDay Noel 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
