<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to ($mpNpcs.lin or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜班查房结束后的医院值班休息室里，<<else>>安静整洁的医院二楼值班休息室里，<</if>>林恩正为你调配一盒随身携带的本草护手膏，桌上放着一盅芦荟精萃与一只白瓷小扁盒：「你平时四处奔波，把这个带在身上我才放心。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回林恩身边 (0:03)|Hospital front]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_lin_11 is 1>>
本草护手膏已分装入白瓷扁盒，清凉草木香令人心神舒缓。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP RelDay Lin 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去下一处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-lin-11">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "搅匀芦荟膏 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-lin-11">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_lin_11 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Lin love 2>><<mpnpcincr Lin trust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_lin_11_rew")>><<money 440>>膏体凝成温润玉色，林恩执起你的手细细涂抹，顺手把夜班巡防补贴塞进你外衣袋。<<else>>清凉药膏抚平了指尖劳顿，林恩低头在你手背落下一记轻吻。<</if>><span class="green">林恩细致入微的守护让你在任何险境中都有底气。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>><<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Hospital front]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">道别离开 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	搅拌速度稍快，膏体里混入了几个细小气泡。<span class="red">林恩覆上你的手背带着你顺时针慢搅。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Lin 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Hospital front]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "装好护手膏 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-lin-11">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_lin_11 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_lin_11_salve"] to 1>><<mpnpcincr Lin love 2>><<mpnpcincr Lin trust 2>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_lin_11_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>白瓷扁盒装得饱满平整，林恩将你揽入怀中，把药房特批的顾问信物铜牌交给你保管。<<else>>盒盖严丝合缝，林恩替你理好衣领，眼底满是温柔笑意。<</if>><span class="green">你们在平淡日常里早已筑起了牢不可破的默契。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP RelDay Lin 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	刮刀边缘沾了少许药膏，抹平盒口时溢出了半毫。<span class="red">林恩拿消毒棉签替你拭净盒沿。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Lin 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Hospital front]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Lin 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to ($mpNpcs.lin or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>细雨洗净了医院顶楼玻璃药棚的顶窗，<<else>>微风拂过医院顶楼阳光药棚的草药架，<</if>>林恩取出一枚刻有双蛇甘菊纹的银质平安扣，药架旁摆着一篮刚晒干的洋甘菊与一把小药剪：「无论你在镇上哪个角落，只要你需要，我随时都在。」
<<if $mpClues["clue_lin_11_salve"]>><span class="teal">指尖还留着方才芦荟护手膏的清香，你接过银质平安扣时触感格外温润。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回林恩身边 (0:03)|Hospital front]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_lin_12 is 1>>
双蛇甘菊银质平安扣已贴身收好，药棚里弥漫着宁神的甘菊甜香。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP RelDay Lin 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-lin-12">
<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>><<link "系上平安扣 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-lin-12">>
<<if (($housekeeping or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_lin_11_salve'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_lin_12 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Lin love 2>><<mpnpcincr Lin lust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_lin_12_rew")>><<money 480>>平结打得端正牢固，林恩将平安扣挂在你颈间，俯身深吻并塞给你一封厚实的安保红利。<<else>>银扣贴着胸口发暖，林恩双臂环着你的肩膀陪你远眺小镇灯火。<</if>><span class="green">林恩沉默而坚定的誓言成了你最可靠的后盾。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Hospital front]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	红丝绳质地柔滑，收紧双环结时滑开了半寸。<span class="red">林恩伸指替你按住绳结中心。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Lin 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Hospital front]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">替林恩把平安扣系上红绳 (0:07)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link "收拢干甘菊 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-lin-12">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_lin_12 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Lin love 2>><<mpnpcincr Lin trust 2>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_lin_12_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>干花朵朵饱满完好，林恩欣慰地揉了揉你的发顶，把积攒的私房薪酬悉数交给你。<<else>>甘菊清香盈满衣袖，你们在药棚长椅上相依而坐，心境澄明无比。<</if>><span class="green">相濡以沫的温情让你们的心紧紧连在一起。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>><<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP RelDay Lin 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">继续同行 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	小药剪刃口略紧，剪花茎时震落了两片花瓣。<span class="red">林恩笑着把花瓣拾进香囊袋。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Lin 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Hospital front]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Monet 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cliff">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to ($mpNpcs.monet or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>点亮琉璃吊灯的峭壁画廊天窗画室里，<<else>>海天一色的峭壁画廊顶层天窗画室里，<</if>>莫奈正在调制做定情肖像浮雕用的雪花石膏，调色台上摆着一瓶玫瑰金箔粉与一把象牙塑形刀：「我想把你现在的模样做成浮雕章，随身贴在心口。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回莫奈身边 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_monet_11 is 1>>
雪花石膏浮雕章已塑形完毕，玫瑰金箔在光下流转着迷人色泽。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP RelDay Monet 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去下一处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-monet-11">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "修整浮雕 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-monet-11">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_monet_11 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Monet love 2>><<mpnpcincr Monet lust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_monet_11_rew")>><<money 460>>侧脸线条灵动传神，莫奈惊艳地捧起你的脸颊热烈亲吻，将画廊刚入账的润笔金塞给你。<<else>>象牙刀划出柔美弧度，莫奈从身后握着你的手一笔笔描摹你的眉眼。<</if>><span class="green">莫奈炽热而浪漫的才情全都倾注在了你一人身上。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">道别离开 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	石膏初凝时略有些软，刀尖落处深了半毫。<span class="red">莫奈笑着蘸水替你轻轻抹平。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Monet 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "点缀金箔 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-monet-11">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_monet_11 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_monet_11_cameo"] to 1>><<mpnpcincr Monet love 2>><<mpnpcincr Monet trust 2>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_monet_11_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>金箔恰到好处地停在发梢轮廓上，莫奈将你拉进怀里深吻，分给你一封特展纪念信物。<<else>>浮雕章泛起华美光泽，莫奈抵着你的额头低声呢喃着赞美之词。<</if>><span class="green">艺术与爱意在天窗画室里交织得无比绚烂。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP RelDay Monet 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	画室穿堂微风吹动了薄如蝉翼的金箔片。<span class="red">莫奈伸手替你挡住风口。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Monet 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Monet 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cliff">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to ($mpNpcs.monet or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>海雨敲打着峭壁画廊私密展厅的弧形玻璃窗，<<else>>灯火映照的峭壁画廊私密展厅正中央，<</if>>莫奈将一对镶嵌在珍珠母贝底托上的双人浮雕怀表递给你，绒盒旁放着一条暗金表链与一封画展主宾请柬：「表盖一开一合，我们就永远面对面。」
<<if $mpClues["clue_monet_11_cameo"]>><span class="teal">看着表盖内侧刚点缀过玫瑰金箔的浮雕侧影，珍珠母贝的光泽与之相得益彰。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回莫奈身边 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_monet_12 is 1>>
珍珠母贝浮雕怀表已贴身收好，每一次滴答声都像是莫奈的心跳。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP RelDay Monet 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-monet-12">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "扣上表链 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-monet-12">>
<<if (($seductionskill or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_monet_11_cameo'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_monet_12 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Monet love 2>><<mpnpcincr Monet lust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_monet_12_rew")>><<money 500>>暗金表链垂坠优雅，莫奈替你挂在腰间并深深拥吻，把整季画展的首席红利塞进你包里。<<else>>表盖合拢时双人浮雕紧紧相贴，莫奈将你拥在丝绒长椅上耳鬓厮磨。<</if>><span class="green">莫奈用最华美隽永的方式向所有人宣告了你的地位。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	暗金弹簧扣极小，扣合时在母贝边沿滑了一下。<span class="red">莫奈温柔地覆上你的手指帮你扣紧。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Monet 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "签下联名 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-monet-12">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 440>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_monet_12 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Monet love 2>><<mpnpcincr Monet trust 2>><<willpower 1>><<gwillpower>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_monet_12_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>并排的联名签字潇洒飘逸，莫奈欣喜若狂地抱起你转了半圈，将画廊金库副匙与纪念胸针交给你。<<else>>烫金请柬上两人的名字交相辉映，展厅里满是浪漫微醺的气息。<</if>><span class="green">你与莫奈的名字从此在艺术与人生中密不可分。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP RelDay Monet 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">继续同行 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	烫金卡纸表面光滑，落笔第一划时墨迹略浅。<span class="red">莫奈蘸了蘸金墨递回你手中。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Monet 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Ash 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>星光穿透古林树冠洒在守林人营地火塘边，<<else>>晨露清新的古林守林人营地青石案前，<</if>>阿什正用小银刀在白桦木牌上镌刻守护符文，案边放着一罐松脂亮油与一束风干的月桂叶：「刻完最后一道星纹，这枚林间通行牌就彻底认主了。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回阿什身边 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_ash_11 is 1>>
白桦木守护符牌已浸润透亮，散发着清冽的松脂与月桂香气。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去下一处 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-ash-11">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "涂抹符牌纹路 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-ash-11">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_ash_11 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Ash love 2>><<mpnpcincr Ash trust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_ash_11_rew")>><<money 440>>星纹在油光下宛如活物，阿什握住你的手按在自己心口，把古物考据津贴放进你衣袋。<<else>>松脂油渗入细密木纹，阿什张开斗篷将你整个人拢进温暖怀抱。<</if>><span class="green">阿什深沉内敛的守护如同整片古林般坚定不移。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Forest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">道别离开 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	松脂亮油略有些黏稠，涂抹时在槽边聚了一小滴。<span class="red">阿什用拇指指腹替你轻轻抹匀。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "编入牌穗 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-ash-11">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_ash_11 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_ash_11_rune"] to 1>><<mpnpcincr Ash love 2>><<mpnpcincr Ash trust 2>><<trauma -1>><<ltrauma>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_ash_11_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>月桂叶穗清香幽远，阿什低头在你额心落下一吻，将守林人世代秘藏的古币分给你。<<else>>翠绿月桂与白桦木牌相得益彰，林间飞鸟停在枝头安静注视着你们。<</if>><span class="green">你们在古林深处缔结了超越言语的灵魂羁绊。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	风干的月桂叶柄略脆，穿绳时折断了一小片叶尖。<span class="red">阿什挑出一片更完整的月桂叶递给你。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Ash 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>山雨敲打着守林石屋的厚木窗板，炉火温暖，<<else>>阳光透过林叶洒进安静的守林石屋内，<</if>>阿什从壁炉暗格里取出一只传世的青铜星盘怀表与一册手绘林间秘径图，放在你面前的鹿皮垫上：「只要这只星盘还在转，无论你在哪我都能找到你。」
<<if $mpClues["clue_ash_11_rune"]>><span class="teal">白桦木守护符牌与青铜星盘怀表放在一处，两者背面的星纹正好拼成完整的月相。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回阿什身边 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_ash_12 is 1>>
青铜星盘怀表与秘径图已贴身收好，石屋里茶香与松香交融。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-relday-ash-12">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "合拢星盘 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-ash-12">>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ash_11_rune'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_ash_12 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Ash love 2>><<mpnpcincr Ash lust 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_ash_12_rew")>><<money 480>>星盘怀表发出一声清越轻鸣，阿什将你紧紧拥入怀中深吻，把压箱底的考据重酬交给你。<<else>>月相纹严丝合缝，阿什用下巴轻轻摩挲着你的发顶，呼吸温热。<</if>><span class="green">你拥有了阿什全部的秘密与一生一世的守候。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[道别离开 (0:04)|Forest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	青铜星盘外圈刻度极密，转动时差了半格月相。<span class="red">阿什握住你的手指一格格拨准。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "记下安全暗哨 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-ash-12">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_ash_12 to 1>><<mpnpcincr Ash love 2>><<mpnpcincr Ash trust 2>><<willpower 1>><<gwillpower>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_ash_12_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>六处林间安全暗哨熟记于心，阿什欣慰地握紧你的手，将暗哨备用的应急贵宾铜牌塞进你包里。<<else>>手绘秘径图上的每一笔都饱含心血，你们靠在壁炉边低声规划着未来。<</if>><span class="green">整片森林的暗哨从此都为你一人敞开。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[继续同行 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">继续同行 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	羊皮秘径图折痕较深，展开时边角卷了回来。<span class="red">阿什拿两枚古铜币替你压住图角。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

